---
const newsletterEnabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ENABLED === 'true';
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-paper-300 bg-surface-card">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-page px-6 pt-10 pb-7">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-12">
      <div class="max-w-[320px]">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 no-underline" aria-label="convoluted.io home">
          <img src="/logo-mark.svg" width="40" height="24" alt="" />
          <span class="font-serif text-[20px] leading-none font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink-900"
            >convoluted<span class="text-green-600">.io</span></span
          >
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          An engineering blog about the messy middle of systems: platform
          engineering, distributed systems, and the deploys that keep you up at
          night. I untangle it so the next person doesn't have to.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <span class="mb-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] text-faint uppercase">Writing</span>
          <a href="/" class="text-sm text-ink-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-brand hover:text-ink-900">Latest</a>
          <a href="/about" class="text-sm text-ink-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-brand hover:text-ink-900">About</a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <span class="mb-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] text-faint uppercase">Elsewhere</span>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/romogo17"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
            class="text-sm text-ink-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-brand hover:text-ink-900">GitHub</a
          >
          <a href="/rss.xml" class="text-sm text-ink-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-brand hover:text-ink-900">RSS</a>
          {newsletterEnabled && <a href="/about#subscribe" class="text-sm text-ink-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-brand hover:text-ink-900">Email</a>}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 border-t border-paper-300 pt-5 font-mono text-xs text-faint">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} convoluted.io</span>
      <span>built in the open · made with curiosity</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
